---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const lastUpdated = "9 May 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Zondo Studios"
  description="Terms governing your use of zondostudios.com."
>
  <Nav />

  <section class="pt-32 pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight gradient-text">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500 font-mono">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-12">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          These Terms govern your use of <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">zondostudios.com</strong> (the "Site"), operated by Zachariah Peter Hondrou, trading as Zondo Studios ("we", "us", "our"), as a sole trader in Australia. By using the Site, you agree to these Terms.
        </p>
        <p>
          These Terms do <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">not</strong> cover our products. Jarrah Money and any future products operate under their own terms, hosted at their own domains. Links are at the end of this page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Using the site</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            The Site is provided for informational purposes — to introduce our studio and the products we build. You may view its content, share its public URLs, and contact us using the email address provided.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Acceptable use</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>You agree not to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Use the Site in a way that breaches any law or regulation</li>
            <li>Attempt to gain unauthorised access to the Site, its hosting infrastructure, or any related systems</li>
            <li>Disrupt, overload, or interfere with the Site's normal operation</li>
            <li>Scrape or harvest content for use that misrepresents Zondo Studios or its products</li>
            <li>Use the Site to transmit malware or harmful code</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Intellectual property</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            All content on the Site — text, images, code, the Zondo wordmark, the Z mark, and the brand assets in the Brand Kit — is owned by Zondo Studios or licensed to us. You may not copy, modify, or republish this content without permission, except as expressly allowed below.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Press and partner use:</strong> you may use the brand assets we publish on the <a href="/brand" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">/brand</a> page to refer to Zondo Studios in articles, partnership announcements, or directories, provided you follow the usage guidelines on that page (preserve gradients, no recolouring, no distortion).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Third-party links</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            The Site links to third-party websites, including our products at separate domains (such as jarrah.money). We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or terms of those external sites. Visiting them is at your own discretion.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">No warranty</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            The Site is provided on an "as is" basis. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we make no warranties about its availability, accuracy, or fitness for any particular purpose. Information about products on the Site reflects our current intent and may change.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Limitation of liability</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by Australian law, Zondo Studios will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential loss arising out of your use of the Site. Nothing in these Terms limits any rights you have under the Australian Consumer Law that cannot be excluded.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Governing law</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            These Terms are governed by the laws of Australia. Any dispute arising from your use of the Site is subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the Australian courts.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Changes</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We may update these Terms as the Site evolves. The "Last updated" date at the top will reflect any revision. Continued use of the Site after a revision means you accept the updated Terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Product terms</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Our products operate under separate terms:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Jarrah Money:</strong> <a href="https://jarrah.money/terms" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">jarrah.money/terms</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            These Terms do not govern the use of those products.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Questions about these Terms:
            <a href="mailto:hello@zondostudios.com" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">hello@zondostudios.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
